    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411870/extras/cb8ebc106c534c7147e2560837ce5c76.avif?t=1667023481\" /></div><br><br>This application can be used by a child without the help of an adult, but remember that <strong>the interaction you have while playing with them is the best educational gift a child can receive</strong>.<br><br>Discovering Colors - Animals features:<br>- 12 drawings which come alive when the child colors them in!<br>- 4 additional drawings to unlock.<br>- A free painting mode.<br><br>Ideas and tips:<br>- Parents should join in on the first few plays.<br>- Learn color names by saying them aloud!<br>- Talk about the kinds of animals the child is bringing to life.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411870/extras/9ab9322cb8d3ee8fb95892932c34f0c3.avif?t=1667023481\" /></div>",
